WEBVTT

00:06:28.872 --> 00:06:32.400
navdušuje te.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.420
Imam seznam približno 85 pesmi

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:36.999
in še posebej sredi noči

00:06:36.999 --> 00:06:39.054
in ponoči, ker ne uporabljamo luči -

00:06:39.054 --> 00:06:41.854
svetloba privlači meduze,
morske pse,

00:06:41.854 --> 00:06:44.239
privlači ribe,
ki privlačijo morske pse,

00:06:44.239 --> 00:06:46.740
in tako gremo v popolnoma črni noči.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:50.143
Nikoli še niste videli črne,
ki bi bila tako črna.

00:06:50.143 --> 00:06:52.228
Ne vidiš sprednjega dela roke

00:06:52.228 --> 00:06:53.375
in ljudje v čolnu,

00:06:53.375 --> 00:06:55.170
Bonnie in moja ekipa v čolnu,

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.227
samo zamahe rok slišijo

00:06:57.227 --> 00:06:58.439
in vedo, kje sem,

00:06:58.439 --> 00:07:00.498
ker se nič ne vidi.